Package: citest
Title: Conditional Independence Testing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ankur", "Ankan", email = "ankurankan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("GiPHouse", role = "aut"),
    person("The pgmpy Developers", role = "cph"),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = "ctb",
           comment = "see AUTHORS file"))
Description: R bindings for a collection of conditional independence tests
    implemented in Rust. Supports discrete, continuous, and mixed data via
    chi-squared, log-likelihood, Cressie-Read, Freeman-Tukey, modified
    log-likelihood, Pearson correlation, Fisher-z, and Pearson equivalence
    tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/pgmpy/ci-tests
BugReports: https://github.com/pgmpy/ci-tests/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
